      "source": "def validate_text_input(raw_text: str, max_length: int) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Validate text is non-empty and within Unicode-aware length limit (strict).\"\"\"\n    text = raw_text.strip()\n    if not text:\n        raise ResponseValidationError(\"Response text cannot be empty\")\n    if len(text) > max_length:\n        raise ResponseValidationError(\n            f\"Response exceeds maximum length of {max_length} characters \"\n            f\"(submitted: {len(text)})\"\n        )\n    return text\n"
